                                "en": "I prefer to sprinkle chocolate <w>flakes</w> on my slice of bread."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Wil je liever hagelslag of zoete <w>vlokken</w> op je brood?",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
